{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/impact/layout,_N_T_/impact/education/layout,_N_T_/impact/education/page,_N_T_/impact/education"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--ojMVV8f_85PlOduhUbC8M--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/61e6ba784b9e8c83.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-30d4efee758f00d3.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/bde6a985-6be4c19b917583eb.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/212-197509c14b256481.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-9a461252f4b9a221.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/22-81df8e529db65d46.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/650-59bd29c2fde8991c.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-2c4630243a413d2a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/impact/education/page-63e2c629c950f778.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Roots Foundation</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Building structured, on-ground programs that address real needs and deliver sustained outcomes.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"150x67\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#FEF9F1] text-[#4A4749] flex flex-col\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><nav class=\"w-full bg-roots-beige sticky top-0 z-50 shadow-sm border-b border-gray-200/20\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 h-20 flex items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"flex-shrink-0\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Roots Foundation\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"60\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogos%2Frootslogo.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Flogos%2Frootslogo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogos%2Frootslogo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75\"/></a><ul class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8\"><li><a class=\"text-sm transition-colors text-roots-text font-medium hover:text-roots-primary\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm transition-colors text-roots-text font-medium hover:text-roots-primary\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a></li><li class=\"relative group py-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer\"><a class=\"text-sm transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 text-roots-primary font-semibold\" href=\"/impact\">Impact Hub<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li><a class=\"text-sm transition-colors text-roots-text font-medium hover:text-roots-primary\" href=\"/governance\">Governance</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm transition-colors text-roots-text font-medium hover:text-roots-primary\" href=\"/news\">News and Insights</a></li></ul><a class=\"hidden md:inline-flex items-center px-5 py-2.5 bg-roots-primary text-white text-sm font-semibold rounded hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity\" href=\"/partner\">Partner With Us</a><button class=\"md:hidden p-2 text-roots-text hover:text-roots-primary transition-colors focus:outline-none cursor-pointer\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></nav><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"bg-[#FEF9F1] min-h-screen text-left\"><section class=\"bg-roots-education py-20 px-6 text-white text-center\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-graduation-cap w-12 h-12 mb-4 animate-bounce-slow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 10v6\"></path><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg><h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4\">Education &amp; Career Readiness</h1><p class=\"text-lg text-white/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light\">Equipping young students and school systems with modern learning tools to secure a brighter tomorrow.</p></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\"><div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-roots-text mb-6\">Igniting Minds, Enhancing Classrooms</h2><p class=\"text-[#4A4749] text-base leading-relaxed mb-6\">Primary education in remote areas often lacks the resources to prepare children for a digital future. We address this by upgrading classrooms with smart learning kits and training educators to utilize digital content effectively.</p><p class=\"text-[#4A4749] text-base leading-relaxed\">By working in alignment with local school boards, we help reduce dropout rates and improve core learning levels in Math, Science, and English. We also conduct career guidance workshops to assist high school students in selecting professional pathways.</p></div><div class=\"relative h-[300px] md:h-[400px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg select-none\"><img alt=\"Rural children learning\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-w-768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white py-20 px-6 border-y border-gray-100\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-roots-text text-center mb-16\">Key Education Initiatives</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"p-8 bg-[#FEF9F1]/50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"mb-4 bg-white w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-monitor w-5 h-5 text-roots-education\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"16\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"21\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"17\" y2=\"21\"></line></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] mb-2\">Smart Classrooms Setup</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749]/80 leading-relaxed\">Installing digital screens, audio-visual study materials, and smart boards to make core STEM learning fun and interactive.</p></div></div><div class=\"p-8 bg-[#FEF9F1]/50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"mb-4 bg-white w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open w-5 h-5 text-roots-education\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] mb-2\">Teacher Mentoring Programs</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749]/80 leading-relaxed\">Running structured training courses for local teachers to update classroom management, digital tools, and active learning models.</p></div></div><div class=\"p-8 bg-[#FEF9F1]/50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"mb-4 bg-white w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award w-5 h-5 text-roots-education\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] mb-2\">Career Paths Guidance</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749]/80 leading-relaxed\">Conducting counseling sessions and tech bootcamps to guide rural students toward secondary education and modern workforce paths.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-6 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-roots-text mb-6\">Support Our Education Programs</h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-[#4A4749]/70 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto\">Help us scale smart classrooms to more government schools. Partner with Roots Foundation to build structured educational campaigns.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center px-8 py-3.5 bg-roots-education text-white text-sm font-semibold rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity shadow-md\" href=\"/partner\">Partner in Education</a></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-roots-footer-gray\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-10 py-10\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\"><a class=\"inline-block\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Roots Foundation\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"110\" height=\"55\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogos%2Frootslogo.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Flogos%2Frootslogo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogos%2Frootslogo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75\"/></a><div><p class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749] mb-3 leading-snug\">Sign up to recieve newsletter</p><div class=\"flex border border-[#09569a] rounded overflow-hidden\"><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter Your Mail\" class=\"flex-1 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-[#4A4749] bg-white outline-none placeholder-gray-400\" value=\"\"/><button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-[#09569a] text-white text-sm font-medium hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity\">Submit</button></div><p class=\"text-xs text-[#4A4749] mt-3 leading-relaxed\">By subscribing, you agree to our Privacy Policy and consent to receive updates from us.</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-5 h-5 text-[#09569a] mt-0.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><p class=\"text-xs text-[#4A4749] leading-relaxed\">UNITECH BUSINESS PARK, Sector 17-B,<br/>Block F, South City I, Sector 41,<br/>Gurugram, Haryana 122003</p></div></div><div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] mb-5\">Quick Links</h3><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749] hover:text-[#09569a] transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749] hover:text-[#09569a] transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749] hover:text-[#09569a] transition-colors\" href=\"/governance\">Governance</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749] hover:text-[#09569a] transition-colors\" href=\"/news\">News and Insights</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749] hover:text-[#09569a] transition-colors\" href=\"/careers\">Careers</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] mb-5\">Impact Verticals</h3><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749] hover:text-[#09569a] transition-colors\" href=\"/impact/agriculture\">Agriculture and Environment</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749] hover:text-[#09569a] transition-colors\" href=\"/impact/sports\">Sports and Physical Literacy</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749] hover:text-[#09569a] transition-colors\" href=\"/impact/education\">Education and Career Readiness</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749] hover:text-[#09569a] transition-colors\" href=\"/impact/skills\">Skill and Community Development</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] mb-4\">Partner With Us</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749] leading-relaxed mb-6\">Partner with us to build structured, on-ground programs that address real needs and deliver sustained outcomes.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-5 py-3 bg-[#09569a] text-white text-sm font-semibold rounded hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity\" href=\"/partner\">Partner With Us</a></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-gray-200\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-5 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749]\">Copyright @ Roots Foundation 2026. All Rights Reserved</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><a href=\"https://linkedin.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-[#4A4749] hover:text-[#09569a] transition-colors\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M19 3A2 2 0 0 1 21 5V19A2 2 0 0 1 19 21H5A2 2 0 0 1 3 19V5A2 2 0 0 1 5 3H19M18.5 18.5V13.2A3.26 3.26 0 0 0 15.24 9.94C14.39 9.94 13.4 10.46 12.92 11.24V10.13H10.13V18.5H12.92V13.57A1.46 1.46 0 0 1 14.38 12.11A1.46 1.46 0 0 1 15.84 13.57V18.5H18.5M6.88 8.56A1.68 1.68 0 0 0 8.56 6.88C8.56 5.95 7.81 5.19 6.88 5.19A1.69 1.69 0 0 0 5.19 6.88C5.19 7.81 5.95 8.56 6.88 8.56M8.27 18.5V10.13H5.5V18.5H8.27Z\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://instagram.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-[#4A4749] hover:text-[#09569a] transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Instagram\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7.8 2h8.4C19.4 2 22 4.6 22 7.8v8.4a5.8 5.8 0 0 1-5.8 5.8H7.8C4.6 22 2 19.4 2 16.2V7.8A5.8 5.8 0 0 1 7.8 2m-.2 2A3.6 3.6 0 0 0 4 7.6v8.8C4 18.39 5.61 20 7.6 20h8.8a3.6 3.6 0 0 0 3.6-3.6V7.6C20 5.61 18.39 4 16.4 4H7.6m9.65 1.5a1.25 1.25 0 0 1 1.25 1.25A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 17.25 8A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 16 6.75a1.25 1.25 0 0 1 1.25-1.25M12 7a5 5 0 0 1 5 5a5 5 0 0 1-5 5a5 5 0 0 1-5-5a5 5 0 0 1 5-5m0 2a3 3 0 0 0-3 3a3 3 0 0 0 